## Subtracting a multiple of 12 months

```catala
#[test]
declaration scope SubMonths:
  output one_year content date
  output seventeen_months content date
  output two_years content date
  output one_month content date
  output addition content date
  output in_years content date

scope SubMonths:
  definition one_year equals |2024-01-15| - 12 month
  assertion one_year = |2023-01-15|
  definition seventeen_months equals |2024-06-15| - 17 month
  assertion seventeen_months = |2023-01-15|
  definition two_years equals |2024-01-15| - 24 month
  assertion two_years = |2022-01-15|
  definition one_month equals |2024-01-15| - 1 month
  assertion one_month = |2023-12-15|
  definition addition equals |2024-01-15| + 12 month
  assertion addition = |2025-01-15|
  definition in_years equals |2024-03-31| - 1 year
  assertion in_years = |2023-03-31|
```

```catala-test-cli
$ catala test-scope SubMonths
┌─[RESULT]─ SubMonths ─
│ one_year = |2023-01-15|
│ seventeen_months = |2023-01-15|
│ two_years = |2022-01-15|
│ one_month = |2023-12-15|
│ addition = |2025-01-15|
│ in_years = |2023-03-31|
└─
```
